      "text": "Hence, more health-related issues will occur. So, what is the role in all of this for artificial intelligence? It can support, it does support older adults by providing tools for independent living. Remember I said persons want to live without having to be cared for. And they have virtual assessments, smart home devices, all which can provide reminders. They can help to manage finances and most importantly monitor safety and health. We have apps now on telephones that can turn off lights, turn off the stove that you forgot to turn off, turn off the fan, and these are the sort of things that help older persons live independently. And most importantly, help family members not to worry. So, AI can play a constructive role in improving the physical and psychological well-being,",
