      "text": "It can tell you about medication. And most importantly, as well, the social support, going back to what I said about loneliness. Staying connected with loved ones is vital for the mental health and emotional health of older persons. And it's made easier by AI-driven tools. The virtual reality tools actually allow for interaction. We have many grandparents that have not physically met their grandchildren, especially after COVID when many stop traveling. It's video calls and virtual visits that keep families connected. We have families that when you ask who's your nearest relative, they live in some far-off country. Older people are also part of social media and online communities. Seniors can join social media platforms and have online communities that cater to their interests and hobbies.",
